                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How long does supplement registration take?</h3>
                                        <p>India FSSAI: 3-6 months. UAE MoHAP: 3-8 months per SKU. USA FDA notification: much faster (weeks) but claims scrutiny is strict. UK / Australia: 2-6 months.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the ideal subscription attach rate for supplements?</h3>
                                        <p>30-50% is achievable with proper flow design. Above 50% exceptional. Below 25% means UX or pricing needs work.</p>
                                        <h3>Should supplements go on Amazon?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes for volume + discovery, but keep premium SKUs / bundles brand.com-only to protect margin and subscription growth.</p>
                                        <h3>How do I compete with Athletic Greens?</h3>
                                        <p>Category focus (they own general daily-nutrition). Better solved problem (sleep, gut, hormones), category-first content, and price positioning matter more than trying to beat their $77 AOV green powder.</p>
